  "description": "Lee Gi-Joo, sick and tired of his miserable outcast life, realizes he needs a girlfriend to escape it. But the girl he falls for at first sight just happens to be the daughter of a boxing gym owner. While trying to turn his life around by getting a girlfriend, Gi-Joo instead starts to fall for the true charm of boxing in the ring.\n\n*“Endurance doesn’t just come naturally!”*\n\nThe story of an outcast fighting for a life turnaround through boxing!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
